msgstr ""

#: ../../../admin-guide/blockdev/zram.rst:571
msgid ""
"With CONFIG_ZRAM_MEMORY_TRACKING, user can know information of the zram "
"block. It could be useful to catch cold or incompressible pages of the "
"process with*pagemap."
